Match Score (70% Weight)
Criteria:
Skill match
Role relevance
Experience alignment
Portfolio fit

Formula:
Match Score = 0–10

Interest Score (30% Weight)
Criteria:
Response enthusiasm
Active job search indicators
Curiosity level
Passive vs active intent
Formula:
Interest Score = 0–10

Final Score Formula:
Final Score = (Match Score × 0.7) + (Interest Score × 0.3)
